---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import FAQSchema from '../../components/FAQSchema.astro';
import { serviceFAQs } from '../../data/serviceFAQs';
import { getService } from '../../data/services';

const service = getService('permanent-tint-touch-up');

const pageTitle = "Root Touch Up Colour, $130, Kaukapakapa";
const pageDescription = "Permanent tint root touch up in Kaukapakapa, North Auckland. $130, about 1-1.5 hours with Melissa. Seamless blend, free parking, online booking.";

const faqs = serviceFAQs['permanent-tint-touch-up'];
---

<ServiceLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  price={service.price}
  duration={service.duration}
  h1={service.h1}
  serviceName={service.name}
  image="/images/optimized/natural-balayage_800.webp"
>
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Seamless Root Coverage for Continuous Colour</h2>
  
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Maintain your beautiful colour with our permanent tint and touch-up service. Perfect for covering new growth, grey hair, or maintaining your existing shade, this service focuses on the root area to seamlessly blend with your current colour. It's the ideal maintenance solution between <a href="/services/permanent-tint-all-over/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">full colour applications</a>, keeping you looking polished and put-together.
  </p>

  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Weighing up full coverage against something softer? Melissa also does grey blending. Read <a href="/blog/grey-blending-vs-grey-coverage/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">grey blending vs grey coverage</a>.
  </p>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Understanding Root Touch-Ups</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Root touch-ups are essential for maintaining coloured hair, typically needed every 4-6 weeks as your natural hair grows. This service applies permanent colour to the new growth area (usually 1-2 inches from the scalp), perfectly matching your existing colour for an undetectable blend. It's a quick, efficient way to keep your colour looking fresh without processing your entire head.
  </p>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Benefits of Regular Touch-Ups</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Maintains consistent, polished appearance</li>
    <li>100% grey coverage at the roots</li>
    <li>Prevents visible regrowth lines</li>
    <li>Protects previously coloured hair from over-processing</li>
    <li>More affordable than full colour services</li>
    <li>Quick service fits easily into busy schedules</li>
    <li>Extends the life of your overall colour</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Perfect For</h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Grey Coverage</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Those needing to cover grey hair as it grows in</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Colour Maintenance</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Clients with existing permanent colour</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Busy Schedules</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Quick service for time-conscious clients</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Budget-Friendly</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Regular maintenance at an accessible price</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">The Touch-Up Process</h3>
  <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Assessment of new growth and existing colour</li>
    <li>Precise colour matching to your current shade</li>
    <li>Protection of skin and previously coloured hair</li>
    <li>Application of colour to root area only</li>
    <li>Processing time based on hair type and grey coverage needs</li>
    <li>Gentle emulsification to blend seamlessly</li>
    <li>Thorough rinse and conditioning treatment</li>
    <li>Professional blow-dry and style</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Grey Coverage Expertise</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Covering grey hair requires special expertise, as grey strands are often more resistant to colour. Melissa's technique ensures:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Pre-softening resistant grays when needed</li>
    <li>Proper developer selection for optimal coverage</li>
    <li>Extended processing time for stubborn grays</li>
    <li>Natural-looking results that don't appear flat or dull</li>
    <li>Long-lasting coverage that won't fade quickly</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Maintenance Schedule</h3>
  <div class="bg-[#FFDEE2] bg-opacity-20 rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
    <h4 class="font-semibold mb-3">Recommended Timeline:</h4>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
      <li>Fast-growing hair: Every 3-4 weeks</li>
      <li>Average growth: Every 4-6 weeks</li>
      <li>Slow-growing hair: Every 6-8 weeks</li>
      <li>High grey percentage: Every 3-5 weeks</li>
      <li>Minimal gray: Every 5-7 weeks</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mt-3">
      Regular appointments prevent the "skunk stripe" effect and maintain your polished look.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Between Appointments</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Extend the life of your colour between touch-ups with these professional tips:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Use colour-safe, sulfate-free shampoo</li>
    <li>Apply root touch-up powder for emergencies</li>
    <li>Style hair to disguise regrowth (zigzag parts, textured styles)</li>
    <li>Protect colour from sun and chlorine with a <a href="/services/uv-protection-treatments/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">UV protection treatment</a></li>
    <li>Use dry shampoo to extend time between washes</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="bg-[#D3E4FD] bg-opacity-20 rounded-lg p-6">
    <p class="text-gray-700 italic">
      "Consistent root touch-ups are the secret to always looking polished. It's a small investment of time that makes a huge difference in your overall appearance and confidence."
    </p>
  </div>
  <!-- FAQ Schema -->
  <Fragment slot="after">
    <FAQSchema 
      faqs={faqs} 
      pageUrl="https://hairbymelissa.co.nz/services/permanent-tint-touch-up/"
    />
  </Fragment>
</ServiceLayout>